smb3-rs
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Randomization logic (world/level/koopaling/item shuffles and the reachability
model) in this project is ported and adapted from smb3-rs, a randomizer for
Super Mario Bros. 3 (USA Rev 1).

  Project: smb3-rs
  Source:  https://github.com/hamstringquestionable/smb3-rs
  License: MIT

Ported files carry a header noting the smb3-rs source module they derive from.

smb3-rs, in turn, acknowledges:
  - Fred (fcoughlin) — original SMB3R and inspiration
  - MaCobra52 — continuing the community work
  - Captain Southbird — the comprehensive SMB3 disassembly (see below)

