SMB3 Disassembly (Southbird)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ROM/RAM addresses, symbol names, and the base patch are derived from the
Super Mario Bros. 3 full disassembly by Southbird (Captain Southbird).

  Project: smb3 (SMB3 full disassembly)
  Source:  https://github.com/captainsouthbird/smb3
           http://www.sonicepoch.com/sm3mix/

Per the disassembly's own request, we credit the Southbird disassembly. Its
attribution is embedded in each .asm source header under disasm/ (a separately
obtained copy, not redistributed as part of this repository).
